SUMMARY:🏋️ Optional - Build C (accessories + cardio)
DESCRIPTION:RE-ENTRY WEEK: first week back after the hike. Do only 2 sets
  of each exercise (not 3)\, moderate weights\, and skip the finisher if 
 legs feel worked. Ease in - the hike was a big load.\n\nOPTIONAL 3rd ses
 sion - accessories + conditioning (skip guilt-free on a busy week). ~40 
 min:\n1. Bulgarian split squat 3x8/leg (single-leg strength + balance)\n
 2. Chest-supported dumbbell row 3x12 (pure back/posture\, no lower-back 
 fatigue)\n3. Dumbbell curl 3x12 + triceps pushdown 3x12 (arms - optional
  'vanity'\, totally fine)\n4. Standing calf raise 3x15 + hanging/lying l
 eg raise 3x12\n5. CONDITIONING FINISHER (10-15 min): incline treadmill @
  10-12%\, OR stairmaster\, OR 3-4 rounds of 40s step-ups / 20s rest. Kee
 ps the hiking engine ticking.\n\nWARM-UP (5 min): incline treadmill walk
  or bike\, then leg swings\, arm circles\, 10 band pull-aparts + 5 bodyw
 eight squats to wake up glutes/upper back.\n\nPOSTURE CUE (all day\, not
  just gym): ribs down\, shoulders back-and-down\, crown of head tall. On
  every row/pulldown\, squeeze shoulder blades together and DOWN - that's
  the rounded-back fix.
CATEGORIES:Fitness,Optional
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
