SUMMARY:🎯 Build Week 4 (Build)
DESCRIPTION:Strongest week of the block so far - push the top sets (leave
  1-2 reps in the tank).\n\nTue = Session A (quad-focus). Thu = Session B
  (hinge/pull). Sat = optional accessories + conditioning.
