BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:build-wk4-a@gym-program-2026
DTSTAMP:20260829T120000Z
SEQUENCE:0
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261013T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261013T184500
SUMMARY:🏋️ Gym - Build A (legs + posture)
DESCRIPTION:BUILD A - full body (quad-focus) + posture. ~45 min:\n1. Gobl
 et or barbell back squat 3x8-10 (primary leg builder\; chest tall\, sit 
 between the hips)\n2. Dumbbell bench press or chest-press machine 3x10 (
 pushing strength)\n3. Seated cable row 3x10-12 (mid-back thickness - the
  anti-slouch muscle\; squeeze blades together)\n4. Reverse or walking lu
 nge 3x10/leg (single-leg strength + glutes)\n5. Face pulls 3x15 (rear de
 lts/upper back - posture)\n6. Hanging knee raise or lying leg raise 3x12
  + 30s plank (core)\n\nFINISHER (optional\, 5 min): incline walk or 2 ro
 unds farmer carry 40m.\n\nWARM-UP (5 min): incline treadmill walk or bik
 e\, then leg swings\, arm circles\, 10 band pull-aparts + 5 bodyweight s
 quats to wake up glutes/upper back.\n\nPROGRESS: when you hit the TOP of
  the rep range on all sets with good form\, add a little weight next tim
 e. Log your weights - beating last week IS the program.\n\nPOSTURE CUE (
 all day\, not just gym): ribs down\, shoulders back-and-down\, crown of 
 head tall. On every row/pulldown\, squeeze shoulder blades together and 
 DOWN - that's the rounded-back fix.
CATEGORIES:Fitness
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
