 rts or rear-delt fly 3x15 (upper-back posture volume)\n6. Pallof press 3
 x12/side or side plank 3x30s/side (anti-rotation core)\n\nFINISHER (opti
 onal\, 5 min): incline walk or step-ups.\n\nWARM-UP (5 min): incline tre
 admill walk or bike\, then leg swings\, arm circles\, 10 band pull-apart
 s + 5 bodyweight squats to wake up glutes/upper back.\n\nPROGRESS: when 
 you hit the TOP of the rep range on all sets with good form\, add a litt
 le weight next time. Log your weights - beating last week IS the program
 .\n\nPOSTURE CUE (all day\, not just gym): ribs down\, shoulders back-an
 d-down\, crown of head tall. On every row/pulldown\, squeeze shoulder bl
 ades together and DOWN - that's the rounded-back fix.
CATEGORIES:Fitness
TRANSP:OPAQUE
