 0s step-ups / 20s rest. Keeps the hiking engine ticking.\n\nWARM-UP (5 m
 in): incline treadmill walk or bike\, then leg swings\, arm circles\, 10
  band pull-aparts + 5 bodyweight squats to wake up glutes/upper back.\n\
 nPOSTURE CUE (all day\, not just gym): ribs down\, shoulders back-and-do
 wn\, crown of head tall. On every row/pulldown\, squeeze shoulder blades
  together and DOWN - that's the rounded-back fix.
